  "description": "Extra (flag 8). The trip of pf11_19 records the park-and-ride cell P = (4,3), side 0. A second search on the same object with flag 8 keeps P: start rect (4,4) gives Car start nodes at (4,3) (sides 0 and 2); popping a node at P adds the Car node P + dir(0) = (3,3) with entry side EdgeTo((4,3) -> (3,3)) = 2 at cost 0.0. The trip to the end rect (1,4) then costs 0 + 1.5 + 1.5 = 3.0 instead of 4.5. Without flag 8, P is reset to (-2,-2) and the trip costs 4.5.",
